OL,4,                                   G1/2 
OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GToday:FA damp start across the spine   
OL,8,Fof the UK, with snow across northern   
OL,9,Fhills, turning patchier through the    
OL,10,Fafternoon. Brighter as it clears for   
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland and Scotland though   
OL,12,Fwith blustery showers. Staying dry but 
OL,13,Foften cloudy in the southeast.         
OL,15,GTonight:FPatchy rain turns more        
OL,16,Fpersistent overnight, heaviest across  
OL,17,Fthe southwest. Clear spells across the 
OL,18,Ffar west, Northern Ireland and         
OL,19,FScotland bring a widespread frost.     
OL,20,FStaying dry in the southeast.          
OL,23,D]C        From the Met Office          
