OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GSaturday:FA wet day for most,          
OL,8,Fparticularly across southern England   
OL,9,Fand Wales with strong winds developing 
OL,10,Ftowards high ground and the coasts,    
OL,11,Fpotentially gale force at times in the 
OL,12,Fnortheast.                             
OL,14,GOutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FTurning 
OL,15,Fmilder by day and by night. A brighter 
OL,16,Fday on Sunday, with blustery showers   
OL,17,Ftowards the northwest. Wet and windy   
OL,18,Fweather gradually sweeps               
OL,19,Fsoutheastwards through Monday into     
OL,20,FTuesday.                               
