OL,4,CZelensky criticises 'strange' Trump-   
OL,5,CPutin friendship in BBC interview      
OL,6,GVolodymyr Zelensky has voiced deep     
OL,7,Gfrustration with the US, criticising   
OL,8,GDonald Trump for calling Vladimir      
OL,9,GPutin "my friend" and saying delays in 
OL,10,Gdelivering vital anti-ballistic        
OL,11,Gmissiles were costing Ukrainian lives. 
OL,13,FIn an interview with the BBC at his    
OL,14,Fcentral Kyiv office, Ukraine's         
OL,15,Fpresident complained the US was not    
OL,16,Fpushing Russia hard enough in peace    
OL,17,Ftalks, and called it "strange" that    
OL,18,FTrump posted a photo of himself        
OL,19,Fembracing Putin.                       
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
