OL,4,CGerman boat dealer suspected of        
OL,5,Csupplying Channel smuggling gangs, BBC 
OL,6,Cfinds                                  
OL,7,GA German boat dealer is suspected by   
OL,8,GEuropean authorities of being a key    
OL,9,Gsupplier to migrant smugglers          
OL,10,Goperating in the English Channel, the  
OL,11,GBBC can reveal.                        
OL,13,FNearly a third of small-boat crossings 
OL,14,Fin the first four months of this year  
OL,15,Fallegedly involved boats or engines    
OL,16,Ffrom MaReBoote, a small firm in        
OL,17,Fwestern Germany, according to files we 
OL,18,Fhave seen.                             
